+ * of 1.25 ms), below the 7.5 ms Bluetooth minimum. Zephyr's own low-latency
+ * scheme reinterprets values under 6 as 500 us units, which would misread the
+ * console's 5 ms as 2.5 ms — so lower the threshold instead, keeping standard
+ * 1.25 ms units for 4 and 5. See .dev/docs/switch2-ble-output-plan.md.
+ */
